[h1]Food Drying - French Translation[/h1]

[b]Build 42.21 · Singleplayer & Multiplayer[/b]

Complete French translation of [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3747396551]Food Drying [B42][/url] by Corvus and its VFE compatibility patch: recipes, dried and salted food, trays and skewers, salt and brine, drying rack, tooltips and sandbox options.

[h2]How to use[/h2]
[list]
[*]Enable [b]Food Drying [B42][/b] and this mod.
[*]Set the game language to [b]Français[/b] in the game options.
[*]In multiplayer, each player sees the mod in their own language: install it on the server and the clients.
[/list]

[h2]Notes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Translation only: no gameplay change, safe to add or remove at any time.
[*]Based on Food Drying 1.11. New texts added by later updates appear in English until this translation is updated.
[/list]

